This Flag enables/disables the\nProtection of Files\n- Show all Files: All Files will listed\n- Release  Protect with PW:  This hides\n  all  Files,  but  you  can switch it off\n  with the Protect-Command\n- Filter H-Flag Files:  All Files, which\n  have set the H-Flag, will hide
